{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"So, you can tell us why you didn't explain the paints to Sabrine, I suppose?\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:00:07.497000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865910736802676747","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"they shrug. `Not much to explain, I don't quite understand it either. She suddenly just... got up, shoved some essences into a box, and zoomed off to Ferrytown.`","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:01:13.521000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865911013727535145","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"`Her eyes were that spooky void thing they do. I feel like I should know why, but I... don't.`","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:02:12.432000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865911260817522689","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Okay, that's mega weird.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:09:53.690000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865913195474714646","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Yeah, never had that happen to me either. Not that I'm too magical or anything.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:19:20.791000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865915574068838446","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'...this further shows I need to speak with the Mender. Maybe he'll know something... I'm worried about this mass of horrors.'","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:20:04.932000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865915759209218058","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"My eyes go white sometimes but that's because Eurus or Orphy are lending me their eyes. This is a very young pact for me but... that hasn't happened yet *at all*.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:20:13.590000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865915795522584606","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"Kukudh transforms into a horned spider with an uncountable amount of limbs, and looks slightly offended.","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:20:28.148000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865915856583917598","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"If you're experiencing weirdo blackouts and doing stuff you don't have control over? I dunno. Super sketchy.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:20:43.022000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865915918970388500","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'But then at the same time... it helped. I - I guess it was me? - rebuilt the Ferrytown games.'","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:21:18.351000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865916067150954496","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"`Yeah, and she WAS muttering something about how I didn't get to play ring toss.` Sabrine gives them a confused look, but they continue, `I guess painting with your tongue isn't normal for most people though, huh?`","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:22:17.477000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865916315142324244","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I don't know. Many things I haven't seen back home seem normal here.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:23:56.601000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865916730898645022","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Everything is weird to me. I've lived a very long time, so I just let it all happen.\" She shrugs. \"There's nothing I haven't seen but the label of weird always works.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:25:34.656000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865917142171516949","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Okay, there are some things I haven't seen. But still.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:25:52.752000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865917218070724609","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'I have only a few months of memory, but so many things seem oddly familiar...'","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:27:07.339000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865917530912718858","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Honestly, my brain washes itself of what isn't important. It would be *super big* now if it kept every thought I've had since the day I was born.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:28:19.902000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865917835263082547","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"she stares off into the distance for a while, before, '...I don't know if I want to regain my memories. Heore said it might be better for me to not, and if I was a bad person... but at the same time. I still don't know who or what I am. And I need to find out about this horror somehow.'","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:32:22.204000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865918851552116766","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I've always been a firm believer that you are not what you do but clearly you have moments where you don't even know what you're doing.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:33:45.692000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865919201725251594","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"she curses in Deep Speech. 'And this! I don't know if this is even a language that exists, but yet I know the rules, I can understand it. And I don't know why.'","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:38:43.105000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865920449166442505","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"the frustration is overpowering her ladylike persona, she visibly looks scared.","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:39:54.775000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865920749772734484","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Some things might not necessarily come from learning the usual way. None of my bugs go through a training program to know what to do, and yet they have that instinctive understanding of the situation and the mutual deal I have with them.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:40:45.630000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865920963072753704","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Literally have no idea what you just said.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:41:00.457000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865921025261961256","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I used to have a spell that helped but, ever since I got the ravens.\" She shrugs.","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:41:20.888000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865921110956048405","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'It translates to, ah...' her cheeks darken. 'I-I cannot say it in Common. Or ask Kukudh to.'","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:41:51.836000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865921240761368597","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"though, thinking about the bugs makes her relax a little. 'Fascinating creatures, though... We could learn a lot from them.'","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:43:08.770000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865921563445690428","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"You wanna know a weird fact about me?\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:43:46.857000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865921723193622538","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
