{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"She pulls out one of her teeth, holds it out for Sabrine to take. \"Try it.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:44:18.685000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865921856690978836","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Wait, don't eat it!\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:44:26.081000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865921887711920138","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"Kukudh looks disappointed.","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:44:33.318000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865921918065180673","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I realize now how that sounds. Just... just hold it.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:44:38.103000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865921938135842876","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
