{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"Roy looks at Seraxa, then Sabrine, then loops back and repeats it a few times.","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:46:15.372000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865922346112253973","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Weird shit, right?\" She says out loud. \"I can only do it with whoever holds that,\" she points to her tooth. \"It's usually just one-way so I'll assume the reply was all you.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:46:30.565000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865922409835528202","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"she nods. 'I've had this telepathy as long as I can remember. With Kukudh, it goes any distance, but anyone else has to be close by.'","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:46:53.545000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865922506219978752","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"And if you're wondering, my teeth grow back every time I go to sleep. It's super itchy, though. Like teething all over again.\" \n\nSeraxa laughs. \"That's not fair. You just said you don't remember much.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:47:46.188000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865922727020855326","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Telepathy's more common than I imagined.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:48:27.689000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865922901088927744","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"she shrugs. 'Well, yes, but... it implies I either had it before I died, or as a result of such.'","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:48:37.976000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865922944236650496","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Probably part of your pact with the apparent 'mass of horrors.'\" She makes air quotes with her fingers. \"Honestly, don't you think that's a little reductive? What if it's nice and you're just being really mean about it behind its back?\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:49:46.670000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865923232359251968","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'I... don't know. I'm just going by what Mender said about it, I don't know how to communicate with it or anything...'","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:50:16.238000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865923356377481216","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Maybe Kukudh would know?\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:50:31.187000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865923419077083166","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"`It's weird. I feel like I should. And I know I did before I got slightly punched to death by Redcoats. So why don't I?`","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:51:14.294000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865923599882125332","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
